# Second layer of protection for the bootstrap scripts.
#
# stow.fish never gives this folder to stow, because the folder name starts
# with "!". This file also blocks the contents, for the case that somebody
# types "stow */" by hand in the repository root.
#
# The line below is a Perl regex, not a file pattern. "." means any character
# and "*" means any count, so the line matches every name in this folder.
# Nothing here reaches your home folder.
#
# Keep this file, and keep the "!" in the folder name.
.*
